    {
      "number": 2859,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve say, “This [Qur’an] is nothing but a lie which he has fabricated, with the help of other people.” What they claim is totally unjust and false.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 25,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الفُرۡقَانِ",
