      "hizbQuarter": 144,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2863,
      "text": "or a treasure had been cast down to him, or he had a garden to eat from it.” The wrongdoers say, “You are following none but a bewitched man.”",
      "surah": {
